Liquid Personnel is recruiting a Locum Occupational Therapist for its client to join Major Adaptations &amp; Assistive Technology, based in Bromley, Kent . &nbsp;

Are you an experienced Occupational Therapist looking for your next opportunity?

We are currently recruiting for TWO Occupational Therapists to join a service in Bromley, with opportunities available within both the Major Adaptations Team and Assistive Technology Team.

Offering flexible hybrid working, these roles provide an excellent opportunity to use your clinical expertise to make a real difference to residents across the borough. &nbsp;

What will your responsibilities be?

